    "faq_XyKTzC": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_row_XdLKBG": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q1. What is affiliate marketing?",
            "answer": "<p>Affiliate marketing is a partnership model in which publishers, creators, or other partners promote your products and earn a commission for qualifying actions, such as completed sales. Tracking links or codes connect those actions to the referring partner.</p>",
            "open_by_default": true
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_ckALeW": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q2. Can ME help us launch a new affiliate program?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Our proposed launch scope covers strategy, platform and setup coordination, tracking validation, partner materials, and recruitment. We first assess your website, product offering, and margins to define a practical starting point.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_8DWdMn": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q3. Can you improve an existing affiliate program?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. We review your partner mix, activity levels, commission structure, and measurement setup. The findings help determine whether the priority is recruitment, partner activation, cost efficiency, or broader program changes.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_6Vcq7e": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q4. What types of partners can we work with?",
            "answer": "<p>Potential partners include content publishers, creators, review and comparison sites, and loyalty or rewards platforms. The right mix depends on your customers, markets, product category, and commercial objectives.<br/></p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_idcK38": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q5. How do you choose affiliate partners?",
            "answer": "<p>We assess audience relevance, market coverage, content quality, promotional methods, and alignment with your brand. Recruitment focuses on partners with a clear role in your customer journey.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_mtDEQH": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q6. How are affiliate commissions decided?",
            "answer": "<p>Commission recommendations consider product margins, order value, acquisition goals, and partner contribution. Different rates or incentives may be proposed for different products, partner groups, or qualifying actions.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_TfzdMb": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q7. How do you measure performance?",
            "answer": "<p>We agree on a measurement framework before launch or optimization. Depending on the data available, this can include active partners, conversions, affiliate revenue, new customer orders, and acquisition costs. Attributed sales alone do not establish incremental growth.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_CGMX33": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q8. How soon can we expect results?",
            "answer": "<p>Timing depends on your starting point, platform readiness, partner recruitment, and customer purchase cycle. We establish milestones during planning and distinguish early indicators, such as partner activation, from sales outcomes.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_H88kCk": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q9. What will our team need to provide?",
            "answer": "<p>Typical inputs include website and platform access, product information, brand guidelines, promotional assets, and commercial parameters. Your team also approves program terms, commissions, and key offers.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "faq_row_ABzErp": {
          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q10. Does affiliate marketing replace our other marketing channels?",
            "answer": "<p>Affiliate marketing can complement paid media, SEO, email, and other channels. Coordinating promotions and measurement across channels helps create a consistent customer experience and makes overlapping contributions easier to assess.</p>",
            "open_by_default": false
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
